CentralHome_ClaudeCode_BuildPackage/
CentralHome_ClaudeCode_BuildPackage.zip
HomeHub_ClaudeDesign/
HomeHub_ClaudeDesign.zip
HomeHub_Audit/
# Extracted design-handoff bundles (the .zips are ignored below; keep their unpacked folders out too).
HomeHub_*/
*.zip
# Extracted doc bundle — the authoritative copies of these live at the repo root.
homehub-docs/

